---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import RemoteImage from "../../components/RemoteImage.astro";
import "../../style/base01.css";
import "../../style/base04.css";
---

<BaseLayout title="ニュース投稿 | 創英祭 2026" noindex>
	<style>
	.post-hero-title {
		text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
	}
	.panel {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
		border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
		box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
	}
	.field-label {
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		color: rgb(51 65 85);
	}
	.field {
		width: 100%;
		border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.45);
		border-radius: 2px;
		background: rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.95);
		color: rgb(15 23 42);
		padding: 0.8rem 0.9rem;
		outline: none;
		transition:
			border-color 0.2s ease,
			box-shadow 0.2s ease,
			background-color 0.2s ease;
		font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
	}
	.field:focus {
		border-color: rgb(132 204 22);
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.12);
	}
	.field-textarea {
		min-height: 120px;
		resize: vertical;
		line-height: 1.85;
	}
	.editor {
		min-height: 330px;
		padding: 1rem;
		line-height: 1.9;
	}
	.editor:empty::before {
		content: attr(data-placeholder);
		color: rgb(148 163 184);
		pointer-events: none;
	}
	.toolbar {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.45rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35);
		border-bottom: 0;
		padding: 0.55rem;
		background: rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.8);
	}
	.tool-btn {
		min-width: 2.3rem;
		height: 2.3rem;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		border: 1px solid transparent;
		font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.tool-btn:hover,
	.tool-btn.active {
		border-color: rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.8);
		background: rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.08);
	}
	.radio-card {
		display: block;
		cursor: pointer;
		border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.38);
		padding: 1rem;
		transition: 0.2s ease;
	}
	.radio-card:hover {
		border-color: rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.7);
	}
	.radio-card.active {
		border-color: rgb(132 204 22);
		box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgb(132 204 22);
		background: rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.05);
	}
	.status-message {
		min-height: 1.6rem;
		font-size: 0.86rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.is-hidden {
		display: none !important;
	}
	.media-preview {
		max-width: 300px;
		max-height: 220px;
		object-fit: contain;
		display: block;
		border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3);
	}
	.help-text {
		font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: rgb(100 116 139);
	}
	.youtube-ok {
		color: rgb(22 163 74);
	}
	.youtube-ng {
		color: rgb(220 38 38);
	}
	</style>

	<section class="relative w-full h-[300px] md:h-[390px] overflow-hidden flex bg-slate-900">
		<RemoteImage src="https://yokohamasoei.sakura.ne.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/IMG_0529-scaled.jpg" alt="" width={1920} height={1080} class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-55" style="filter: grayscale(10%);" />
		<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900 via-slate-900/65 to-transparent"></div>
		<div class="relative w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto h-full flex items-end pb-12 px-6 sm:px-12 z-10">
			<div>
				<p class="text-xs md:text-sm font-sans tracking-[0.28em] text-brand-orange mb-4">NEWS ADMINISTRATION</p>
				<h1 class="post-hero-title text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-[0.12em] text-white mb-3">ニュース投稿</h1>
				<p class="text-slate-300 tracking-widest font-light text-sm md:text-base">Firebase認証ユーザー専用</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<main class="py-20 md:py-24 bg-brand-surfaceLight slant-top transition-colors duration-300">
		<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
			<section id="login-panel" class="panel p-7 sm:p-10 md:p-12">
				<div class="mb-9 border-b border-slate-200 pb-5">
					<p class="text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-orange mb-3">AUTHENTICATION</p>
					<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-900">ログイン</h2>
					<p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
						Firebase Authenticationに事前登録されたユーザーのみ利用できます。<br>このページから新しいメールアドレスを登録する機能はありません。
					</p>
				</div>

				<form id="login-form" class="space-y-6" novalidate>
					<div>
						<label class="field-label" for="login-email">メールアドレス</label>
						<input
							id="login-email"
							class="field"
							type="email"
							autocomplete="username"
							inputmode="email"
							required
							placeholder="example@example.com"
						>
					</div>
					<div>
						<label class="field-label" for="login-password">パスワード</label>
						<input
							id="login-password"
							class="field"
							type="password"
							autocomplete="current-password"
							required
							placeholder="パスワード"
						>
					</div>
					<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
						<button
							id="login-button"
							type="submit"
							class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-7 py-3.5 border border-slate-900 bg-slate-900 text-white hover:opacity-85 transition tracking-widest text-sm font-sans"
						>
							<i class="fa-solid fa-right-to-bracket"></i>ログイン
						</button>
						<button
							id="reset-button"
							type="button"
							class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-7 py-3.5 border border-slate-300 text-slate-800 hover:bg-white/60 transition tracking-widest text-sm font-sans"
						>
							<i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i>パスワード再設定
						</button>
					</div>
					<p id="login-message" class="status-message text-slate-500" aria-live="polite"></p>
				</form>
			</section>

			<section id="post-panel" class="panel p-7 sm:p-10 md:p-12 is-hidden">
				<div
					class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between gap-5 mb-9 border-b border-slate-200 pb-5"
				>
					<div>
						<p class="text-xs font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-brand-lime mb-3">POST</p>
						<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-900">新しい記事を投稿</h2>
						<p id="current-user" class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-sans mt-3"></p>
					</div>
					<button
						id="logout-button"
						type="button"
						class="self-start md:self-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 border border-slate-300 text-slate-800 hover:bg-white/60 transition tracking-widest text-xs font-sans"
					>
						<i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right-from-bracket"></i>ログアウト
					</button>
				</div>

				<form id="post-form" class="space-y-7" novalidate>
					<div>
						<span class="field-label">属性</span>
						<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
							<label class="radio-card active" data-category-card>
								<input type="radio" name="post-type" value="news_release" checked class="sr-only">
								<span class="flex items-start gap-4"
									><span
										class="radio-dot mt-1 h-3.5 w-3.5 rounded-full border border-brand-lime bg-brand-lime shrink-0"
									></span><span
										><span class="block text-base font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-900">ニュースリリース</span
										><span class="block text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-500 mt-2 font-sans"
											>公式発表・重要なお知らせ</span
										></span
									></span
								>
							</label>
							<label class="radio-card" data-category-card>
								<input type="radio" name="post-type" value="topic" class="sr-only">
								<span class="flex items-start gap-4"
									><span class="radio-dot mt-1 h-3.5 w-3.5 rounded-full border border-slate-300 shrink-0"></span
									><span
										><span class="block text-base font-bold tracking-widest text-slate-900">トピック</span
										><span class="block text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-500 mt-2 font-sans"
											>実行委員会からの話題・紹介</span
										></span
									></span
								>
							</label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div>
						<label class="field-label" for="post-title">タイトル</label>
						<input
							id="post-title"
							class="field"
							type="text"
							maxlength="120"
							required
							placeholder="記事タイトルを入力してください"
						>
					</div>

					<div class="border border-slate-200 p-4 bg-slate-50/60">
						<p class="field-label mb-2">公開番号</p>
						<p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
							記事番号は投稿順に自動付与されます。最初の投稿が
							<strong>#1</strong>、次が <strong>#2</strong> …となり、公開URLは
							<code class="font-sans">https://www.soei-fes.com/news/#番号</code>
							です。
						</p>
					</div>

					<div>
						<label class="field-label" for="post-author">投稿者名</label>
						<input
							id="post-author"
							class="field"
							type="text"
							maxlength="80"
							required
							placeholder="例：創英祭実行委員会"
						>
					</div>

					<div>
						<label class="field-label">本文</label>
						<div class="toolbar" id="editor-toolbar" aria-label="本文の書式設定">
							<button type="button" class="tool-btn" data-command="bold" title="太字">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-bold"></i>
							</button>
							<button type="button" class="tool-btn" data-command="underline" title="下線">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-underline"></i>
							</button>
							<button type="button" class="tool-btn" data-command="strikeThrough" title="取り消し線">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-strikethrough"></i>
							</button>
							<button type="button" class="tool-btn" data-command="removeFormat" title="書式を解除">
								<i class="fa-solid fa-eraser"></i>
							</button>
						</div>
						<div
							id="post-content"
							class="field editor"
							contenteditable="true"
							role="textbox"
							aria-multiline="true"
							data-placeholder="本文を入力してください。URL（https://… や www.…）は表示時に自動でリンクになります。"
						></div>
						<p class="help-text mt-2">本文の一部を選択して、太字・下線・取り消し線を設定できます。</p>
					</div>

					<div>
						<label class="field-label" for="post-image">画像（任意）</label>
						<input id="post-image" class="field" type="file" accept="image/*">
						<p class="help-text mt-2">
							ブラウザ内で最も長い辺を600px以下へ縮小し、JPEGのBase64として保存します。Firestoreのサイズ制限を考慮し、必要に応じて追加圧縮します。
						</p>
						<div id="image-preview-wrap" class="hidden mt-4">
							<img id="image-preview" class="media-preview" alt="画像プレビュー">
							<p id="image-size-text" class="help-text mt-2"></p>
							<button
								id="image-clear-button"
								type="button"
								class="mt-2 text-xs border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2 font-sans tracking-wider"
							>
								画像を取り除く
							</button>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div>
						<label class="field-label" for="post-youtube">YouTube動画（任意）</label>
						<input
							id="post-youtube"
							class="field"
							type="url"
							inputmode="url"
							placeholder="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XXXXXXXXXXX"
						>
						<p id="youtube-message" class="help-text mt-2">
							YouTubeの通常URL・youtu.be・Shorts・embed
							URLを利用できます。公開ページでは埋め込みプレーヤーとして表示します。
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="border-t border-slate-200 pt-7">
						<button
							id="post-button"
							type="submit"
							class="inline-flex w-full sm:w-auto items-center justify-center gap-3 px-9 py-4 border border-slate-900 bg-slate-900 text-white hover:opacity-85 transition tracking-widest text-sm font-sans"
						>
							<i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i>投稿する
						</button>
						<p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-4 leading-relaxed font-sans">
							投稿後、公開ページで記事を確認できます。番号とURLの #番号
							はFirestore上で自動的に採番されます。
						</p>
					</div>
					<p id="post-message" class="status-message" aria-live="polite"></p>
				</form>
			</section>
		</div>
	</main>

	<script src="../../scripts/site-interactions.ts"></script>
	<script src="../../scripts/secret-trigger.ts"></script>

	<script src="../../scripts/news-editor.ts"></script>
</BaseLayout>
